(157, 2, 9, 'aria', 'Hello teststudenttt. I\'m Aria, your wellness companion. To help us get the most out of our session today, could you start by telling me: \n\n1. How would you rate your mood today (1-10)? \n2. Have there been any major changes since we last spoke? \n3. What is the primary concern or feeling on your mind right now?', '2026-04-19 03:34:03'),
