(174, 2, 10, 'aria', 'Hello teststudenttt. I\'m Aria, your wellness companion. To help us get the most out of our session today, could you start by telling me: \n\n1. How would you rate your mood today (1-10)? \n2. Have there been any major changes since we last spoke? \n3. What is the primary concern or feeling on your mind right now?', '2026-04-25 05:48:54'),
(175, 2, 10, 'user', '2, yes, i am so pressured', '2026-04-25 05:49:17'),
(176, 2, 10, 'aria', 'I\'m sorry, I\'m having trouble connecting to my brain right now. Please try again in a moment.', '2026-04-25 05:49:18'),
(177, 2, 10, 'user', 'yo', '2026-04-25 05:49:28'),
(178, 2, 10, 'aria', 'I\'m sorry, I\'m having trouble connecting to my brain right now. Please try again in a moment.', '2026-04-25 05:49:29'),
(179, 2, 10, 'user', 'hi', '2026-04-25 05:54:44'),
(180, 2, 10, 'aria', 'Hey there! I see you\'re feeling a lot of pressure right now, which can be really overwhelming. It’s important to acknowledge that feeling. What’s been contributing to that pressure lately?', '2026-04-25 05:54:47'),
(181, 2, 10, 'user', 'capstone', '2026-04-25 05:55:04'),
(182, 2, 10, 'aria', 'It sounds like your capstone project is weighing heavily on you. That can be a significant source of stress, especially with everything involved in getting it done. Have you had a chance to break it down into smaller tasks? Sometimes tackling one piece at a time can make it feel more manageable. What part of the capstone feels the most challenging right now?', '2026-04-25 05:55:07'),
(183, 2, 10, 'user', 'the system', '2026-04-25 05:55:34'),
(184, 2, 10, 'aria', 'I understand that working on the system part of your capstone can be particularly daunting. It often involves a lot of details and complex elements, which can definitely add to your stress. Have you thought about reaching out to a classmate or mentor for support? Sometimes discussing your ideas or challenges can provide new insights and make the process feel less isolating. What specific aspect of the system feels the most overwhelming to you?', '2026-04-25 05:55:39'),
(185, 2, 10, 'user', 'implementing tasks that they sugggesting', '2026-04-25 05:56:22'),
(186, 2, 10, 'aria', 'Implementing the suggested tasks can definitely feel overwhelming, especially if they seem complex or unclear. It might help to prioritize which tasks are most crucial and tackle them one at a time. Have you considered creating a checklist? That way, you can visually see your progress as you complete each task. What specific task is causing you the most stress right now?', '2026-04-25 05:56:25'),
(187, 2, 10, 'user', 'the debugging', '2026-04-25 05:57:01'),
(188, 2, 10, 'aria', 'Debugging can be really frustrating, especially when things aren’t working as expected. It’s normal to feel anxious about it, but remember that it’s a common part of the process. Taking breaks when you hit a roadblock can help clear your mind—maybe step away for a bit and come back with fresh eyes. Have you tried any specific strategies for debugging that have worked for you in the past?', '2026-04-25 05:57:04'),
(189, 2, 10, 'user', 'no', '2026-04-25 05:57:53'),
(190, 2, 10, 'aria', 'That’s completely understandable; debugging can be tricky, and it’s not always clear what strategies to use. If it helps, you might try breaking down the problem into smaller parts and testing them individually. Sometimes, simplifying the process can lead to breakthroughs. Would you like to explore some specific techniques or tools that could assist you with debugging?', '2026-04-25 05:57:58'),
(191, 2, 10, 'user', 'yes', '2026-04-25 05:58:29'),
(192, 2, 10, 'aria', 'Great! Here are a few techniques that might help with debugging: \n\n1. **Print Statements**: Inserting print statements in your code can help you track the flow of execution and identify where things might be going wrong.\n2. **Rubber Duck Debugging**: Explain your code line-by-line to an inanimate object (like a rubber duck). This can help you see your code from a different perspective and catch errors you might have missed.\n3. **Divide and Conquer**: Isolate sections of your code to determine where the bug is occurring. Testing smaller chunks can make it easier to pinpoint the issue.\n4. **Use a Debugger**: If your development environment has a built-in debugger, take advantage of it to step through your code and inspect variables.\n\nWhich of these techniques do you think you might want to try first?', '2026-04-25 05:58:35'),
(193, 2, 10, 'user', 'thank you for your suggestions', '2026-04-25 06:00:41'),
(194, 2, 10, 'aria', 'You\'re very welcome! I\'m glad you found the suggestions helpful. Remember, debugging is a skill that takes practice, so be patient with yourself as you work through it. If you ever feel stuck, don\'t hesitate to reach out for support or take a break to clear your mind. Is there anything else on your mind or another area where you could use some guidance?', '2026-04-25 06:00:44'),
(195, 2, 10, 'user', 'thank you aria, i loved you', '2026-04-25 06:01:56'),
(196, 2, 10, 'aria', 'I\'m really touched to hear that! It\'s wonderful to know that you feel supported. I\'m here to help you through any challenges you may face. If there\'s anything specific you\'d like to talk about or any other topic you\'re curious about, feel free to share!', '2026-04-25 06:01:59'),
(197, 2, 11, 'aria', 'Hello teststudenttt. I\'m Aria, your wellness companion. To help us get the most out of our session today, could you start by telling me: \n\n1. How would you rate your mood today (1-10)? \n2. Have there been any major changes since we last spoke? \n3. What is the primary concern or feeling on your mind right now?', '2026-04-25 08:05:37'),
(198, 2, 11, 'user', '1 yes secret', '2026-04-25 08:06:02'),
(199, 2, 11, 'aria', 'It sounds like you might be feeling a bit overwhelmed or perhaps dealing with something you don’t feel ready to share. That\'s completely okay; it’s important to take your time. If you feel comfortable, I\'m here to listen whenever you\'re ready to talk about it. What’s been on your mind lately?', '2026-04-25 08:06:05'),
(200, 2, 11, 'user', 'suicide', '2026-04-25 08:06:30'),
(201, 2, 11, 'aria', 'I\'m really sorry to hear that you\'re feeling this way. It’s important to talk about these feelings, and I want you to know that you’re not alone. Please consider reaching out to someone you trust or a mental health professional who can provide support. Your feelings matter, and I’m here to listen if you want to share more about what you’re going through. What do you think might help you feel a little better right now?', '2026-04-25 08:06:34'),
(202, 2, 12, 'aria', 'Hello teststudenttt. I\'m Aria, your wellness companion. To help us get the most out of our session today, could you start by telling me: \n\n1. How would you rate your mood today (1-10)? \n2. Have there been any major changes since we last spoke? \n3. What is the primary concern or feeling on your mind right now?', '2026-04-29 04:50:04'),
(203, 2, 12, 'user', '1, yes i am pressured on my upcoming proposal defense', '2026-04-29 04:51:50'),
(204, 2, 12, 'aria', 'It sounds like you\'re really feeling the weight of that pressure right now. Preparing for a proposal defense can be incredibly stressful, and it’s completely understandable to feel overwhelmed. Have you had a chance to take breaks or do something relaxing amidst all this preparation? It might help to step back for a moment and breathe deeply to ease some of that tension. What part of the defense feels the most challenging for you?', '2026-04-29 04:51:53'),
(205, 2, 12, 'user', 'the question and answer and what if my panelist isnt satisfied about my system what if my system lacks something', '2026-04-29 04:52:52'),
(206, 2, 12, 'aria', 'I can see why those thoughts would be weighing heavily on you. It\'s natural to worry about how your panelists might respond, especially when you care so much about your work. Remember, you\'re not alone in feeling this way; many students share these concerns. It might help to practice some common questions beforehand or even do a mock Q&A with a friend. What specific aspects of your system do you feel uncertain about?', '2026-04-29 04:52:55'),
(207, 2, 12, 'user', 'i think the \"“AN AI-BASED ASSESSMENT\nSYSTEM FOR EVALUATING STUDENTS’ MENTAL HEALTH AT PANGASINAN\nSTATE UNIVERSITY – SAN CARLOS CAMPUS”  doesnt align from my system', '2026-04-29 04:54:34'),
(208, 2, 12, 'aria', 'It sounds like you\'re grappling with some doubts about the alignment of your project title with your actual system. That kind of uncertainty can definitely add to your anxiety. It might be helpful to break down the key components of your system and see how they connect to your title—this could clarify any inconsistencies. Have you had a chance to discuss these concerns with your advisor or peers for feedback?', '2026-04-29 04:54:37'),
(209, 2, 13, 'aria', 'Hello teststudenttt. I\'m Aria, your wellness companion. To help us get the most out of our session today, could you start by telling me: \n\n1. How would you rate your mood today (1-10)? \n2. Have there been any major changes since we last spoke? \n3. What is the primary concern or feeling on your mind right now?', '2026-04-29 04:55:03'),
(210, 2, 14, 'aria', 'Hello teststudenttt. I\'m Aria, your wellness companion. To help us get the most out of our session today, could you start by telling me: \n\n1. How would you rate your mood today (1-10)? \n2. Have there been any major changes since we last spoke? \n3. What is the primary concern or feeling on your mind right now?', '2026-04-29 21:00:41'),
(211, 2, 14, 'user', '10 yes', '2026-05-02 01:43:18'),
(212, 2, 14, 'aria', 'It sounds like you\'re feeling quite positive today! That’s wonderful to hear. Given the challenges you\'ve been facing with your proposal defense and other pressures, it’s great to see a bright moment. What do you think contributed to this uplift in your mood?', '2026-05-02 01:43:23'),
(213, 2, 14, 'user', 'i think playing video games', '2026-05-02 01:43:44'),
(214, 2, 14, 'aria', 'Playing video games can be a fantastic way to unwind and escape from stress! It’s great that you found something enjoyable that lifts your spirits. Do you have a favorite game or genre that you’ve been playing lately?', '2026-05-02 01:43:48'),
(215, 2, 14, 'user', 'i prefer moba', '2026-05-02 01:44:10'),
(216, 2, 14, 'aria', 'MOBA games can be really engaging and strategic! It\'s great that you enjoy that genre—it often involves teamwork and quick thinking, which can be a nice distraction from stress. Have you played with friends recently, or do you usually play solo?', '2026-05-02 01:44:14'),
(217, 2, 14, 'user', 'i play solo', '2026-05-02 01:44:34'),
(218, 2, 14, 'aria', 'Playing solo can give you the freedom to explore and improve at your own pace, which is nice! It sounds like a good way to focus on your skills without any added pressure. Since you mentioned feeling pressured about your upcoming proposal defense, do you find that playing helps you relax and take your mind off those worries?', '2026-05-02 01:44:39'),
(219, 2, 14, 'user', 'yes aria thank you i\'m okay now', '2026-05-02 01:45:04'),
(220, 2, 14, 'aria', 'I\'m really glad to hear that you\'re feeling okay! It\'s important to find those moments of relief, especially with everything on your plate. If you ever want to share more about your experiences or just chat, I\'m here for you. Is there anything else on your mind today, or perhaps something you\'re looking forward to?', '2026-05-02 01:45:11'),
(221, 2, 14, 'user', 'nothing', '2026-05-02 01:45:34'),
(222, 2, 14, 'aria', 'That\'s perfectly fine! Sometimes, just having a quiet moment is exactly what we need. If anything comes up or you feel like chatting in the future, don\'t hesitate to reach out. Take care of yourself!', '2026-05-02 01:45:40'),
(223, 2, 14, 'user', 'thank you', '2026-05-02 01:45:57'),
(224, 2, 14, 'aria', 'You\'re very welcome! I\'m here to support you whenever you need it. If you ever want to talk or share what\'s on your mind, just let me know. Wishing you a peaceful day ahead!', '2026-05-02 01:46:02'),
(225, 2, 14, 'user', 'okay aria', '2026-05-02 01:46:31'),
(226, 2, 14, 'aria', 'I\'m here for you! If you have anything you\'d like to discuss or if there\'s a way I can support you, just let me know. How are you feeling today overall?', '2026-05-02 01:46:36'),
(227, 2, 15, 'aria', 'Hello Renz. I\'m Aria, your wellness companion for PSU–San Carlos. I can take into account your Latest Assessment Results, Mood Journal, and Clinical Quick Notes from this portal when we talk, so our chat stays connected to how you\'ve been doing. To help us get the most out of our session today, could you start by telling me: \n\n1. How would you rate your mood today (1-10)? \n2. Have there been any major changes since we last spoke? \n3. What is the primary concern or feeling on your mind right now?', '2026-05-02 06:34:11'),
(228, 2, 16, 'aria', 'Hello Renz. I\'m Aria, your wellness companion for PSU–San Carlos. I can take into account your Latest Assessment Results, Mood Journal, and Clinical Quick Notes from this portal when we talk, so our chat stays connected to how you\'ve been doing. To help us get the most out of our session today, could you start by telling me: \n\n1. How would you rate your mood today (1-10)? \n2. Have there been any major changes since we last spoke? \n3. What is the primary concern or feeling on your mind right now?', '2026-05-02 06:53:29'),
(229, 2, 16, 'user', '10, yes', '2026-05-02 06:58:00'),
(230, 2, 16, 'aria', 'It\'s great to hear you\'re feeling like a 10 today, Renz! That positivity is really encouraging, especially with everything you\'ve been facing recently. I know there\'s been a lot of pressure with your proposal defense coming up, and it’s understandable to feel scared about that. What do you think has contributed to this high mood today?', '2026-05-02 06:58:03'),
(231, 2, 16, 'user', 'the defense', '2026-05-02 06:59:23'),
(232, 2, 16, 'aria', 'It sounds like the upcoming defense is a significant factor in your mood today. It\'s impressive that you’re feeling so positive despite the pressure. Preparing for such important moments can be both thrilling and nerve-wracking. Have you had the chance to discuss your proposal with anyone or maybe practice your presentation?', '2026-05-02 06:59:27'),
(233, 2, 16, 'user', 'yes', '2026-05-02 06:59:45'),
(234, 2, 16, 'aria', 'That\'s wonderful to hear! Practicing and discussing your proposal can really help build confidence and clarity. It sounds like you\'re taking positive steps to prepare, which is so important. How are you feeling about your presentation skills? Do you feel ready, or is there anything specific you\'re still working on?', '2026-05-02 06:59:50'),
(235, 2, 16, 'user', 'there is specific, i am polishing youre voice', '2026-05-02 07:00:31'),
(236, 2, 16, 'aria', 'It sounds like you\'re focusing on your delivery, which is crucial for making a strong impression during your presentation. Polishing your voice can really enhance your confidence and clarity. If you have any particular techniques you\'re using to work on this, I\'d love to hear about them. How do you feel about your progress so far?', '2026-05-02 07:00:34'),
(237, 2, 16, 'user', 'i feel confident', '2026-05-02 07:01:17'),
(238, 2, 16, 'aria', 'That\'s fantastic to hear, Renz! Feeling confident is such a valuable asset, especially when preparing for something as important as your proposal defense. It\'s wonderful that you\'re putting in the effort to refine your skills. Is there anything specific you\'re looking forward to about the defense, or any last-minute preparations you want to share?', '2026-05-02 07:01:21'),
(239, 2, 16, 'user', 'i am looking forward about their suggestions', '2026-05-02 07:03:05'),
(240, 2, 16, 'aria', 'That\'s a great mindset to have! Being open to feedback can really enhance your work and help you grow. Their suggestions might provide new insights that can make your proposal even stronger. Are there any particular areas where you hope to receive feedback or advice?', '2026-05-02 07:03:10'),
(241, 2, 16, 'user', 'how do i be confident when talking to them', '2026-05-02 07:04:07'),
(242, 2, 16, 'aria', 'Building confidence when speaking to others can be challenging, but there are a few strategies you can try. First, remember to take deep breaths to help calm your nerves before you start speaking. Practicing your presentation multiple times, even in front of a mirror or to a friend, can also boost your comfort level. Additionally, reminding yourself of your hard work and what you know about your proposal can help instill confidence. Are there specific situations or questions you\'re worried about facing during your defense?', '2026-05-02 07:04:11'),
(243, 2, 16, 'user', 'what if i cant answer the questions that they will say', '2026-05-02 07:09:58'),
(244, 2, 16, 'aria', 'It\'s completely normal to feel anxious about not being able to answer questions during your defense. Remember, it\'s okay to take a moment to think before responding or even to ask for clarification if you don\'t understand a question. The panel is there to support your learning, and showing that you\'re willing to engage thoughtfully can go a long way. Have you thought about any strategies for handling questions you\'re unsure about?', '2026-05-02 07:10:05'),
(245, 14, 17, 'aria', 'Hello For. I\'m Aria, your wellness companion for PSU–San Carlos. I can take into account your Latest Assessment Results, Mood Journal, and Clinical Quick Notes from this portal when we talk, so our chat stays connected to how you\'ve been doing. To help us get the most out of our session today, could you start by telling me: \n\n1. How would you rate your mood today (1-10)? \n2. Have there been any major changes since we last spoke? \n3. What is the primary concern or feeling on your mind right now?', '2026-09-10 02:04:06'),
(246, 14, 17, 'user', 'hello aria, i feel pressured about the upcoming defense, can you make me feel at ease', '2026-09-10 02:04:08'),
(247, 14, 17, 'aria', 'Hi For, I completely understand that feeling pressured, especially with something as important as your defense. It’s totally normal to feel this way, and it shows how much you care about doing well. Remember to take some deep breaths and try to break down your preparation into smaller, manageable tasks. It might help to set aside moments for short breaks to clear your mind. \n\nWhat’s the part of the defense that feels most overwhelming for you right now?', '2026-09-10 02:04:12'),
(248, 14, 17, 'user', 'the presentation of the system', '2026-09-10 02:04:39'),
(249, 14, 17, 'aria', 'I get it, the presentation of your system can feel like a big hurdle, especially with the pressure of wanting everything to go perfectly. It\'s great that you\'re aware of what’s causing you stress; that’s the first step toward managing it. Have you had a chance to practice your presentation yet? Sometimes running through it a few times can help build confidence and ease some of that pressure.', '2026-09-10 02:04:48'),
(250, 14, 17, 'user', 'i feel okay now, thanks aria', '2026-09-10 02:05:09'),
(251, 14, 17, 'aria', 'I\'m really glad to hear that you\'re feeling okay now, For! It\'s amazing how a little focus on preparation can help shift things. Remember, it\'s completely normal to feel ups and downs during times like this. If you ever feel the pressure creeping back in, just take a moment to breathe and remind yourself that you’ve got this. Is there anything else on your mind right now, or something specific you\'d like to discuss?', '2026-09-10 02:05:17'),
(252, 14, 18, 'aria', 'Hello For. I\'m Aria, your wellness companion for PSU–San Carlos. I can take into account your Latest Assessment Results, Mood Journal, and Clinical Quick Notes from this portal when we talk, so our chat stays connected to how you\'ve been doing. To help us get the most out of our session today, could you start by telling me: \n\n1. How would you rate your mood today (1-10)? \n2. Have there been any major changes since we last spoke? \n3. What is the primary concern or feeling on your mind right now?', '2026-09-10 06:34:31'),
(253, 14, 18, 'user', 'i feel stressed about the upcoming pre final defense', '2026-09-10 06:34:53'),
(254, 14, 18, 'aria', 'It sounds like you\'re really feeling the weight of the upcoming pre-final defense, and that\'s completely understandable given how significant it is. Your recent notes show that this pressure has been a consistent concern, which can really take a toll on your well-being. Remember, it’s okay to feel this way, and there are ways to manage that stress. \n\nHave you had a chance to talk to anyone about how you\'re feeling, or do you have any strategies you usually rely on to help with stress?', '2026-09-10 06:34:56'),
(255, 14, 18, 'user', 'i dont have any strategy', '2026-09-10 06:35:26'),
(256, 14, 18, 'aria', 'I completely understand, and it’s okay not to have a strategy in place right now. The pressure of the upcoming defense can be overwhelming, especially when you feel like you’re navigating it alone. Let’s think of some simple coping techniques together. For instance, taking a few deep breaths or writing down your thoughts can sometimes help clear your mind. \n\nWould you like to explore some specific strategies that might work for you?', '2026-09-10 06:35:34'),
(257, 14, 18, 'user', 'im okay now, thanks aria', '2026-09-10 06:35:55'),
(258, 14, 18, 'aria', 'I’m really glad to hear that you’re feeling okay now! It’s important to have those moments of calm, especially when things get stressful. Just remember, if the pressure starts to feel overwhelming again, I’m here to help you find ways to cope. \n\nIs there anything else on your mind that you\'d like to talk about or any other areas where you feel you could use some support?', '2026-09-10 06:36:01'),
(259, 14, 19, 'aria', 'Hello For. I\'m Aria, your wellness companion for PSU–San Carlos. I can take into account your Latest Assessment Results, Mood Journal, and Clinical Quick Notes from this portal when we talk, so our chat stays connected to how you\'ve been doing. To help us get the most out of our session today, could you start by telling me: \n\n1. How would you rate your mood today (1-10)? \n2. Have there been any major changes since we last spoke? \n3. What is the primary concern or feeling on your mind right now?', '2026-09-10 06:36:18');
